      "title" : "シーン 10: 東方Project二次創作作品　Powerd By zuyasi",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.011.jpeg",
      "telop" : "それから、さとりは自席に戻り、しばらくすると、教室の扉がチャイムと同時に開く。そして、担任が入ってくる。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "470B1A3B-090E-4446-B8F5-D5BC4D25A84A",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seName" : "SE: 教室の戸を開ける",
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 1.23,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "seAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/教室の戸を開ける.mp3",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_011_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #11",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.25390022675737,
      "seVolume" : 0.85,
      "duration" : 8.85390022675737,
      "title" : "シーン 11",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.012.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕はいつものように、素早く立ち上がり、クラスメイトと同じタイミングで礼と挨拶をすると、彼女の合図で座る。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "B6264849-8C77-401D-975C-98906482851D",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #12",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.321292517006802,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 7.921292517006802,
      "title" : "シーン 12",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.013.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「それでは、朝礼を始めます。今日は、テスト返却の後は、遠足に向けた、全校集会なので昼食後速やかに移動するように。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "8F48A270-6870-4DC2-9B14-FB39C4CB61F3",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "東風谷早苗",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_東風谷早苗.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "東風谷早苗",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #13",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 9.00156462585034,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.60156462585034,
      "title" : "シーン 13",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.014.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「それと藤原さんは、今学園内で流れている情報の真意を確かめるので、朝礼後、速やかに職員室を訪ねるように。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "07183C42-AED0-4A47-853E-F6B1470D7E0A",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "東風谷早苗",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_東風谷早苗.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "東風谷早苗",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #14",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.785351473922902,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 8.385351473922903,
      "title" : "シーン 14",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.015.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「今日の連絡は以上です。今日も1日、勉学を励みましょう。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "CD102EAA-E99F-41EA-A397-DDC940DD5DF9",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "東風谷早苗",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_015_東風谷早苗.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "東風谷早苗",
