      "telop" : "「ええ、あなたの心身にかかる事柄ですから、\nぜひ、聞かせてください。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "3143545B-3B3F-4F4B-9F7C-5F00D91C660A",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #30",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 4.160680272108843,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 4.760680272108843,
      "title" : "シーン 30",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.031.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕は、彼女の意思を確認すると、過去を思い返しながら話す。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "AE97ECE6-B5AB-47AE-8A33-83ED35141D93",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #31",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 4.356077097505669,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 4.956077097505669,
      "title" : "シーン 31",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.032.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「それで、あなたはこの学校に転校して、良かったですか？」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "1DC11C26-0B90-40C8-AAFC-8D3186517948",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #32",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 3.3903854875283446,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 3.9903854875283447,
      "title" : "シーン 32",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.033.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「ええ、前の学校と比べると、かなり良いです。母に、母の母校に転校したいと言って、良かったと僕は思っています。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "8F1F19B8-BC98-4287-99D2-6BF1B405F6E1",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #33",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.435419501133786,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.035419501133786,
      "title" : "シーン 33",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.034.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「そうですか…、ところで話の節々から、あなたの記憶には、欠けているところがありますが、何か心当たりはありますか？」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "019E136F-46D8-43D7-B98D-226C55B9EB34",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #34",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 6.837482993197279,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 7.437482993197278,
      "title" : "シーン 34",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.035.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「…正直に言って分からないです。小さかった頃は、それこそ些細な違いで、記憶が欠け始めたのは、中学からですから…」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "D751A17F-372E-4376-8291-378B34C9E135",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #35",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.410430839002268,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.010430839002268,
      "title" : "シーン 35",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.036.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「…ただ、証拠を出せというのなら、僕のこの身体が、それを示してます…、正直にいうと人様には見せたくないですが…」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "FCD5C3DC-9886-4771-B112-511D73324117",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #36",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.962607709750567,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 8.562607709750568,
      "title" : "シーン 36",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.037.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「そうですか…。ところで、あなたは、この間の模試を受けている時の様子と、午後の1500m走の様子を見たいですか？」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "C05C037D-C4AC-4C7A-A7E5-68F7A8FBCC51",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #37",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.084580498866213,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 7.684580498866213,
      "title" : "シーン 37",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.038.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「えっ？」僕は、彼女の急な質問に、そう返してしまう。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "1AB1614C-79BD-4C6A-A579-EB998164232A",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #38",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 4.421292517006803,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 5.021292517006803,
      "title" : "シーン 38",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.039.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「もし、見たいのなら、教員用のPCにデータが保存されているので、お見せできますが…、どうしますか？」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "46A3E3ED-9008-49E6-BBC9-553B93233B4E",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #39",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 5.884897959183673,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 6.484897959183673,
      "title" : "シーン 39",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.040.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「えっと…」僕はふと迷う。確かに、こないだの気を失っている間に、自分が何をしてかを見たいが、見たくない気持ちもある。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "2ED09109-1605-42B3-BE69-50EBA2321C13",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #40",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.561519274376417,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.161519274376417,
      "title" : "シーン 40",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.041.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「いや、いいです…」僕は、それから彼女にそう返す。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "1A40A242-BA93-4A4C-B91E-F463999AE31D",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #41",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 3.7039002267573697,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 4.30390022675737,
      "title" : "シーン 41",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.042.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「そうですか…、最後に一つだけ、こないだ渡した例の遠足に関する条件ですが、無事に満たしましたよ、では失礼。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（微笑）.png",
      "id" : "7100A0F3-5C80-42F1-AE6B-3D0D2F77B9A3",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #42",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 6.8395918367346935,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 7.439591836734693,
      "title" : "シーン 42",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.043.jpeg",
      "telop" : "彼女はそういうと、部屋をさっていった。僕は、ゆっくりと立ちあがろうとすると、突如として頭痛が走り、床に崩れ落ちる。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "5CC504D2-2413-481A-8AFC-7C850F8D697F",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #43",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.461519274376418,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.061519274376417,
      "title" : "シーン 43",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.044.jpeg",
      "telop" : "そして、僕の様子を見に戻ってきた彼女を、\n一瞬見ると、そのまま気を失うのだった。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "咲夜（驚く）.png",
      "id" : "7DA4DBDF-8744-4DA4-A9E3-CA0F075579FA",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #44",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 5.488367346938776,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 6.088367346938775,
      "title" : "シーン 44",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "id" : "A03FCF05-AB7F-41DF-97C7-CB9120BB90A5",
      "telop" : "彼がふと気がつくと…",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationDuration" : 1.5,
      "characterName" : "ナレーション",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "animationNote" : "表示時間：1.5秒",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #45",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "title" : "シーン 45",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.045.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.046.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕はふと気がつくと、そこはトイレだった。\nそして、手を洗ってから、トイレを出る。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "1B1601E3-8478-42B6-A4EC-0DB307AC4FBE",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #46",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 5.494126984126984,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 6.094126984126984,
      "title" : "シーン 46",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.047.jpeg",
      "telop" : "そして、学校の廊下を歩いているときに、ふと午後は、全校集会だったことを思い出す。そして、僕は体育館に向かう。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "4E45236B-6A3C-4E31-9B12-7F2052DA8463",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #47",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.458253968253969,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.058253968253968,
      "title" : "シーン 47",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.048.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕が体育館に来ると、すでにほとんどの生徒や児童が集まっているようだった。僕は、ふと周りを見渡し、ある列に入る。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "BBB3B13A-2B06-45B7-94D8-E707750656C9",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #48",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 8.357165532879819,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 8.957165532879818,
      "title" : "シーン 48",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.049.jpeg",
      "telop" : "それから、数時間の間、遠足の説明を聞くのだった。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "BC3CE9E1-5610-4E0D-A0E3-456F1769E99B",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #49",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 3.9658503401360545,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 4.565850340136055,
      "title" : "シーン 49",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "id" : "5AA99E97-959C-409C-B166-638B56BDC5F3",
      "telop" : "説明会が終わり…",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "animationDuration" : 1.5,
      "characterName" : "ナレーション",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "animationNote" : "表示時間：1.5秒",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #50",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "title" : "シーン 50",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.050.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.051.jpeg",
      "telop" : "説明会が終わると、各自が教室に戻り、担任が入ってくる。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "64FB43BF-2B38-4259-AE5A-0537B93047C7",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #51",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 4.50390022675737,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 5.10390022675737,
      "title" : "シーン 51",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.052.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕は、朝と同じように礼と挨拶をして、数分程度の短い週例を終えると、そのまま、学校の校門に向かう。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "A02C0011-7102-476C-A8D4-772A022FBFE8",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #52",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.766938775510204,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 8.366938775510205,
      "title" : "シーン 52",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.053.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕が、学校の校門に来ると、ある車が門の前に止まっていた。\nすると、中からフランが降りてくる。",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "8F741373-180F-47A9-AC09-2DFB8A727370",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #53",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 7.162607709750567,
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 7.762607709750567,
      "title" : "シーン 53",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.054.jpeg",
      "telop" : "「学校、お疲れ様、紅夢。とりあえず、車に乗って。」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "5E7F2ADA-C4AC-4018-936C-41283C53667D",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_フランドール・スカーレット.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #54",
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voiceDuration" : 5.198231292517007,
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 5.7982312925170065,
      "title" : "シーン 54",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233\/元女子校の日常　第14話_98916fb233.055.jpeg",
      "telop" : "僕は、彼女にそう言われ、車に乗ると、数十分で高速に入る。\n「あの、フランさん、どこに行くのですか？」",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "id" : "7CC172FC-B8FE-464C-8221-97C4F7809EB5",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
